WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.759
A director model plans three shots from one story idea.

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.330
For each shot, a Decide node picks which video model should film it.

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.944
Its answer is wired straight into that video node's model field.

4
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.958
Three shots, three different models, one film.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.134
The whole run cost forty-three cents.
